@* Project-wide Razor imports for Novior.MentorAgent.Abstractions components.
   Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Web is REQUIRED for the event-handler directives
   (@onclick, @onchange, @bind, …) to resolve — without it they silently compile as
   literal HTML attributes and no handler ever fires. Keep it here so every component
   in this RCL gets it (previously only a few declared it per-file). *@
@using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Web
